(4959331, 722266, 92296, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the red, but think the centre of the image works really well.  Cropped in tight on her with the torchlight fading into the distance might''ve made my top 3.</td>', 'Not a big fan of the red, but think the centre of the image works really well.  Cropped in tight on her with the torchlight fading into the distance might''ve made my top 3.', '2008-09-17 06:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
