(4959477, 722210, 19641, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love it!  I always want to enter but never do because I can never think of anything clever or creative to do.  You have clearly done that here and I envy your talent.  Oh...  The composition and lighting are fantastic as well.  You may have done it intentionally but the only thing that kept it from being a 10 are the blown highlights on the glove.  Great work!</td>', 'This is great!  I love it!  I always want to enter but never do because I can never think of anything clever or creative to do.  You have clearly done that here and I envy your talent.  Oh...  The composition and lighting are fantastic as well.  You may have done it intentionally but the only thing that kept it from being a 10 are the blown highlights on the glove.  Great work!', '2008-09-17 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959482, 722279, 19641, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I don''t care for the composition, the depth of field or the lighting.  Would have been really impressive if you could have gotten the arrow in flight just before impact.  Obviously it has to be, but you don''t want it to look staged and this just looks staged.  I give you credit for trying though and like I said...  Good idea!</td>', 'Good idea but I don''t care for the composition, the depth of field or the lighting.  Would have been really impressive if you could have gotten the arrow in flight just before impact.  Obviously it has to be, but you don''t want it to look staged and this just looks staged.  I give you credit for trying though and like I said...  Good idea!', '2008-09-17 09:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959483, 722220, 19641, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of capturing the risk in the stock market but don''t really love the photograph.  A scrolling marquee in Time Square would have been cool but if you''re not in New York that could be tough.</td>', 'I love the idea of capturing the risk in the stock market but don''t really love the photograph.  A scrolling marquee in Time Square would have been cool but if you''re not in New York that could be tough.', '2008-09-17 09:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959484, 721899, 80904, '<td valign="top">lol, this is too funny. I liked how you staged it. Great composition</td>', 'lol, this is too funny. I liked how you staged it. Great composition', '2008-09-17 09:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959489, 720711, 19641, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good.  The activity is risky and I''m not sure but I get the feeling that even taking the shot was risky.  Good composition and good exposure.  Wish the body boarder could have been a little more clear though.  It almost looks like the focu point was on the edge of the wave.  Good work!</td>', 'This is pretty good.  The activity is risky and I''m not sure but I get the feeling that even taking the shot was risky.  Good composition and good exposure.  Wish the body boarder could have been a little more clear though.  It almost looks like the focu point was on the edge of the wave.  Good work!', '2008-09-17 09:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959503, 722211, 19641, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot but when I first looked at it I had a different impression regarding the risk.  I thought the risk was either taking on a renovation job that was over your head or flipping a house in a terrible housing market.  Not sure if the "fish eye" look was intentional and I''m not sure I care for it.  Otherwise this is a very good shot.  The lighting and exposure are both good.</td>', 'This is a good shot but when I first looked at it I had a different impression regarding the risk.  I thought the risk was either taking on a renovation job that was over your head or flipping a house in a terrible housing market.  Not sure if the "fish eye" look was intentional and I''m not sure I care for it.  Otherwise this is a very good shot.  The lighting and exposure are both good.', '2008-09-17 09:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4959520, 721960, 3102, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is awesome, but the colors are just a mess, unfortunately.</td>', 'The subject matter is awesome, but the colors are just a mess, unfortunately.', '2008-09-17 09:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
