(4960515, 722251, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  The color in the sky could be boosted a bit to give the shot a bit more punch.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  The color in the sky could be boosted a bit to give the shot a bit more punch.', '2008-09-17 18:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
