(4962162, 721924, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: Certainly fits the challenge. Very cool image.  I love the framing, b/w conversion and sky.  Few nit-picks: the haloing around the parachute and bit of over exposed clouds behind him.  If not basic editing I would see about lightening his face and body a tiny bit and toning down those rear clouds.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=1 comments: Certainly fits the challenge. Very cool image.  I love the framing, b/w conversion and sky.  Few nit-picks: the haloing around the parachute and bit of over exposed clouds behind him.  If not basic editing I would see about lightening his face and body a tiny bit and toning down those rear clouds.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2008-09-18 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962170, 722078, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments: Certainly fits the challenge, but there doesn''t seem to be a lot of sharpness to it.  The colors see weird, brightness could use a boost.  It is also kind of boring and doesn''t do anything for me.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments: Certainly fits the challenge, but there doesn''t seem to be a lot of sharpness to it.  The colors see weird, brightness could use a boost.  It is also kind of boring and doesn''t do anything for me.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2008-09-18 16:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962174, 720627, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=2<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: Certainly fits the challenge. Really a neat image.  I love the drops hanging and the suggestion of danger with the spider web.  I really like your DOF and colors.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=2Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1 comments: Certainly fits the challenge. Really a neat image.  I love the drops hanging and the suggestion of danger with the spider web.  I really like your DOF and colors.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2008-09-18 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962186, 722400, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=2 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments: Fits the challenge well.  You have a very sharp image here with just the right amount of blur down at the board to show actual action.  You did an excellent job and keeping the details in both the darkness of his jeans and the brightness of his shirt and wrist band.  I do wish the rail he is about to be on was sharper and just his board blurry but I still think it works here. Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=2 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments: Fits the challenge well.  You have a very sharp image here with just the right amount of blur down at the board to show actual action.  You did an excellent job and keeping the details in both the darkness of his jeans and the brightness of his shirt and wrist band.  I do wish the rail he is about to be on was sharper and just his board blurry but I still think it works here. Good luck on the challenge.', '2008-09-18 16:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962187, 722321, 55956, '<td valign="top">yes lehman brothers but for an high impact photo you need to capture the image of the traders with the cardboard box(i don''t know if the image is captured before the beginning of the lehman crisis) 6</td>', 'yes lehman brothers but for an high impact photo you need to capture the image of the traders with the cardboard box(i don''t know if the image is captured before the beginning of the lehman crisis) 6', '2008-09-18 16:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962193, 722134, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=2 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: Fit the challenge without a doubt.  Your DOF is outstanding, (did you get some good practice in with the shallow DOF challenge? lol)  I love that I can see the lines under the mushrooms cap.  Stems might be a tad bit bright but I like the overall image.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=2 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1 comments: Fit the challenge without a doubt.  Your DOF is outstanding, (did you get some good practice in with the shallow DOF challenge? lol)  I love that I can see the lines under the mushrooms cap.  Stems might be a tad bit bright but I like the overall image.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2008-09-18 17:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962197, 721859, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments: Nice idea, crop seems a bit tight but your colors and lighting are spot on!  Depth of field is nicely done.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments: Nice idea, crop seems a bit tight but your colors and lighting are spot on!  Depth of field is nicely done.  Good luck.', '2008-09-18 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962230, 722101, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=4 <br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments: While it may seem risky to take a dogs toy, on the most part we probably more see it as playing.  Your lighting is very basement like with no apperance of natural lighting which leads to the noise level and the lack of your subject having any degree of sharpness to it...some motion blur is nice but this isn''t.  Your busy background also hurts your image.</td>', 'Fits challenge=4 Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments: While it may seem risky to take a dogs toy, on the most part we probably more see it as playing.  Your lighting is very basement like with no apperance of natural lighting which leads to the noise level and the lack of your subject having any degree of sharpness to it...some motion blur is nice but this isn''t.  Your busy background also hurts your image.', '2008-09-18 17:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962235, 722324, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=-1 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments: Certainly fits the challenge, but it is way too dark.  There should be any reason why a brighter image of this wouldn''t work.  I like the idea but you can''t even tell what the dangerous item is.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=-1 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments: Certainly fits the challenge, but it is way too dark.  There should be any reason why a brighter image of this wouldn''t work.  I like the idea but you can''t even tell what the dangerous item is.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2008-09-18 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
