(4963093, 722296, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a very interesting photo but if not for your title it would appear he''s trying to give himself a hot foot. Why didn''t you show him doing some actual juggling?</td>', 'It''s a very interesting photo but if not for your title it would appear he''s trying to give himself a hot foot. Why didn''t you show him doing some actual juggling?', '2008-09-19 00:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963094, 721978, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear: 8</td>', 'Very sharp and clear: 8', '2008-09-19 00:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963096, 721986, 62187, '<td valign="top">The edit is a bit strange to me but a good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'The edit is a bit strange to me but a good idea for the challenge.', '2008-09-19 00:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963097, 721999, 62187, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t you go Ace high for a Royal Flush? A good idea but the lighting seems a little harsh to me.</td>', 'Why didn''t you go Ace high for a Royal Flush? A good idea but the lighting seems a little harsh to me.', '2008-09-19 00:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963100, 720931, 62187, '<td valign="top">Could use some more contrast I think but overall a good find for the challenge.</td>', 'Could use some more contrast I think but overall a good find for the challenge.', '2008-09-19 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963101, 722214, 62187, '<td valign="top">You''re right and not worth the risk. Nice shot for the challenge. Too bad you couldn''t get a needle: I think that would have completed your photo. The surface of the table or floor is really cool.</td>', 'You''re right and not worth the risk. Nice shot for the challenge. Too bad you couldn''t get a needle: I think that would have completed your photo. The surface of the table or floor is really cool.', '2008-09-19 00:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963102, 722220, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but imho the execution and edit is not helping.</td>', 'Nice idea, but imho the execution and edit is not helping.', '2008-09-19 00:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963104, 721330, 62187, '<td valign="top">Actually, it''s not a risk but rather a fact. For what it''s worth: I smoked for 28 years and it took 17 days with the help of <a href="//www.chantix.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">CHANTIX</a> to quit. That was 7 months ago.</td>', 'Actually, it''s not a risk but rather a fact. For what it''s worth: I smoked for 28 years and it took 17 days with the help of CHANTIX to quit. That was 7 months ago.', '2008-09-19 00:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963107, 721903, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think the arrow is pointing in the wrong direction. Shouldn''t it be pointing up?!?!?!?! Nice focus but for some reason, the black background is making it look like, but of course it''s not, a ''cut and paste'' job. Why is it that humor in taking a risk is funnier then humor in safety to me?</td>', 'I think the arrow is pointing in the wrong direction. Shouldn''t it be pointing up?!?!?!?! Nice focus but for some reason, the black background is making it look like, but of course it''s not, a ''cut and paste'' job. Why is it that humor in taking a risk is funnier then humor in safety to me?', '2008-09-19 00:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963109, 722213, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pretty sharp photo.</td>', 'Pretty sharp photo.', '2008-09-19 00:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963111, 721461, 62187, '<td valign="top">Blurry on purpose?</td>', 'Blurry on purpose?', '2008-09-19 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963113, 722252, 62187, '<td valign="top">The Hook is a little dark and I almost missed it which is a shame because it''s the point of your photo. However, for those interested - I smoked for 28 years and <a href="//www.chantix.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">CHANTIX</a> helped me quit in 17 days. That was 7 months ago.</td>', 'The Hook is a little dark and I almost missed it which is a shame because it''s the point of your photo. However, for those interested - I smoked for 28 years and CHANTIX helped me quit in 17 days. That was 7 months ago.', '2008-09-19 00:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963115, 721852, 62187, '<td valign="top">Having it sideways is weird to me - nice idea</td>', 'Having it sideways is weird to me - nice idea', '2008-09-19 00:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963117, 721859, 62187, '<td valign="top">You don''t have to tell me about the risks of gambling...</td>', 'You don''t have to tell me about the risks of gambling...', '2008-09-19 00:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963121, 722079, 62187, '<td valign="top">I have no idea - you go first! I like the photo, it''s a great idea but the background is giving up some of it''s quality: it''s not totally black - or maybe I''m just seeing things.</td>', 'I have no idea - you go first! I like the photo, it''s a great idea but the background is giving up some of it''s quality: it''s not totally black - or maybe I''m just seeing things.', '2008-09-19 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963123, 722321, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think we got an answer the other day: a definite risk.</td>', 'I think we got an answer the other day: a definite risk.', '2008-09-19 01:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963128, 720388, 62187, '<td valign="top">I get vertigo REALLY bad - thanks for the view. I can''t look no more...</td>', 'I get vertigo REALLY bad - thanks for the view. I can''t look no more...', '2008-09-19 01:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963129, 722301, 62187, '<td valign="top">Cute - I''m not so sure about the risk of it all. It''s a good photo.</td>', 'Cute - I''m not so sure about the risk of it all. It''s a good photo.', '2008-09-19 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963133, 721924, 62187, '<td valign="top">Definitely miles above the other photos! 10</td>', 'Definitely miles above the other photos! 10', '2008-09-19 01:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963146, 721997, 62187, '<td valign="top">Is not really a risk as it is a condition. I understand your meaning though. It looks like your photo has some vignetting which is illegal. However, sometimes when I use my teleconverter and it''s at a certain point, I get this effect.</td>', 'Is not really a risk as it is a condition. I understand your meaning though. It looks like your photo has some vignetting which is illegal. However, sometimes when I use my teleconverter and it''s at a certain point, I get this effect.', '2008-09-19 01:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
