(4964247, 721926, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/>Comments: "Hey I''m driving here!"  Nice capture, it always amazes me of how close together they race.  Normally I''d like it sharper but given what this is an image of I think it is damn good.  Not totally crazy about the wide-screen appearance (top and bottom crop) but it probably works with the right background.  Might also need a bit of a contrast boost.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=0Comments: "Hey I''m driving here!"  Nice capture, it always amazes me of how close together they race.  Normally I''d like it sharper but given what this is an image of I think it is damn good.  Not totally crazy about the wide-screen appearance (top and bottom crop) but it probably works with the right background.  Might also need a bit of a contrast boost.', '2008-09-19 13:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
