(4964631, 722078, 97010, '<td valign="top">focus is not on your subject, but on the jeep in the background.  exposure could use some work.  it''s a little too dark.</td>', 'focus is not on your subject, but on the jeep in the background.  exposure could use some work.  it''s a little too dark.', '2008-09-19 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
