(4965123, 722291, 62187, '<td valign="top">That''s certainly NOT safe - what a find! The conversion to B&amp;W is really nice: 10</td>', 'That''s certainly NOT safe - what a find! The conversion to B&W is really nice: 10', '2008-09-19 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965124, 722396, 62187, '<td valign="top">If not for the pink sky, I think you might have had a serious contender here.</td>', 'If not for the pink sky, I think you might have had a serious contender here.', '2008-09-19 22:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965268, 722280, 78303, '<td valign="top">I little cropped off the top and right would be better, I think.  But, very nice.</td>', 'I little cropped off the top and right would be better, I think.  But, very nice.', '2008-09-20 01:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965292, 721080, 91614, '<td valign="top">I give you a 6 for making me cry</td>', 'I give you a 6 for making me cry', '2008-09-20 01:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965373, 721999, 88523, '<td valign="top">Straight flush! Where''s the risk! Nice one...</td>', 'Straight flush! Where''s the risk! Nice one...', '2008-09-20 05:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965382, 720711, 66192, '<td valign="top">Is this the wedge?</td>', 'Is this the wedge?', '2008-09-20 06:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965522, 721214, 73250, '<td valign="top">This does not say risky to me...if the title wasn''t there, I''d see a crisp image of a toy plane.</td>', 'This does not say risky to me...if the title wasn''t there, I''d see a crisp image of a toy plane.', '2008-09-20 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965526, 721865, 73250, '<td valign="top">Definitely, out on a limb!!</td>', 'Definitely, out on a limb!!', '2008-09-20 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965536, 721868, 73250, '<td valign="top">I think this would have more impact in b/w? I do like it though...and it does say risk to me.</td>', 'I think this would have more impact in b/w? I do like it though...and it does say risk to me.', '2008-09-20 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965542, 721187, 73250, '<td valign="top">This says safety to me!</td>', 'This says safety to me!', '2008-09-20 10:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965707, 722396, 88054, '<td valign="top">Love the colors</td>', 'Love the colors', '2008-09-20 14:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965711, 722252, 88054, '<td valign="top">Very cleaver. This could be used for an advertisement.</td>', 'Very cleaver. This could be used for an advertisement.', '2008-09-20 14:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965718, 722210, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Sinister look in his eyes. I actually like the strong light source and dark background. It leaves me with the impression that he has something to hide. Don''t care much for the boarder.</td>', 'Great composition. Sinister look in his eyes. I actually like the strong light source and dark background. It leaves me with the impression that he has something to hide. Don''t care much for the boarder.', '2008-09-20 14:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965719, 721926, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great shot...love how you captured the point of impact. The focus is a little soft but at 120mph it''s understandable. Very nice.</td>', 'Great shot...love how you captured the point of impact. The focus is a little soft but at 120mph it''s understandable. Very nice.', '2008-09-20 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965720, 721604, 88054, '<td valign="top">If you are holding a jack and a ten I''d be all in as well. I like the sense of motion.</td>', 'If you are holding a jack and a ten I''d be all in as well. I like the sense of motion.', '2008-09-20 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965721, 722119, 88054, '<td valign="top">Wow! I really like this one. I''m not a mushroom guy but they look poisonous.</td>', 'Wow! I really like this one. I''m not a mushroom guy but they look poisonous.', '2008-09-20 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965722, 721876, 88054, '<td valign="top">Very cleaver. Clean, sharp, well photographed image.</td>', 'Very cleaver. Clean, sharp, well photographed image.', '2008-09-20 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965723, 722112, 88054, '<td valign="top">Beware of the falcon!</td>', 'Beware of the falcon!', '2008-09-20 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965724, 722266, 88054, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors.</td>', 'Interesting colors.', '2008-09-20 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965725, 722020, 88054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-09-20 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965726, 722211, 88054, '<td valign="top">What a great image. love the composition.</td>', 'What a great image. love the composition.', '2008-09-20 14:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965727, 721255, 88054, '<td valign="top">Now thats a lot of fish. Love the colors.</td>', 'Now thats a lot of fish. Love the colors.', '2008-09-20 14:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965728, 721903, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2008-09-20 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965730, 722145, 88054, '<td valign="top">Is that poisonous?</td>', 'Is that poisonous?', '2008-09-20 14:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966030, 721900, 91282, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Probably the only things I''d suggest would be to get the focus a little sharper and maybe try to get the colors just a little more vivid. The set up and all is great, though.</td>', 'I really like this. Probably the only things I''d suggest would be to get the focus a little sharper and maybe try to get the colors just a little more vivid. The set up and all is great, though.', '2008-09-20 19:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966032, 721267, 91282, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but not really a great picture, IMHO. The door knob looks neat, but the rest is very dark and the hand is very unclear. I''m not certain if I would have guessed what this was right away without the title.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but not really a great picture, IMHO. The door knob looks neat, but the rest is very dark and the hand is very unclear. I''m not certain if I would have guessed what this was right away without the title.', '2008-09-20 19:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966034, 722074, 91282, '<td valign="top">haha Very cute. :)</td>', 'haha Very cute. :)', '2008-09-20 19:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966036, 722279, 91282, '<td valign="top">This was actually one of the first things I thought of when I saw the subject for this challenge, and I''m glad someone did it! :) The foreward-most part of the arrow is a bit too blurry for me; I probably would''ve gone with closer cropping. I like the black and white, but I also think the color version would be neat to see as well. :) Overall, its a decent photo and a great take on this challenge.</td>', 'This was actually one of the first things I thought of when I saw the subject for this challenge, and I''m glad someone did it! :) The foreward-most part of the arrow is a bit too blurry for me; I probably would''ve gone with closer cropping. I like the black and white, but I also think the color version would be neat to see as well. :) Overall, its a decent photo and a great take on this challenge.', '2008-09-20 19:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966038, 721903, 91282, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like this a lot. The sign just makes it, and the bird is very crisp. Might have cropped it a bit close, but its still a really great capture regardless.</td>', 'Wow, I like this a lot. The sign just makes it, and the bird is very crisp. Might have cropped it a bit close, but its still a really great capture regardless.', '2008-09-20 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966040, 720911, 91282, '<td valign="top">The blurriness and the black and white makes this feel like there''s a hidden camera at the table that someone''s using to cheat.. lol Its kind of neat.</td>', 'The blurriness and the black and white makes this feel like there''s a hidden camera at the table that someone''s using to cheat.. lol Its kind of neat.', '2008-09-20 20:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966197, 721317, 85344, '<td valign="top">I love the symbolism of today''s current situation abroad.  How it seems our fallen soldiers are nothing more then pawns in a game over the middle east.  I hope our men and women come home safely soon.</td>', 'I love the symbolism of today''s current situation abroad.  How it seems our fallen soldiers are nothing more then pawns in a game over the middle east.  I hope our men and women come home safely soon.', '2008-09-20 22:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966285, 721913, 41479, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC</td>', 'FANTASTIC', '2008-09-21 00:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966301, 721317, 78021, '<td valign="top">Surprised that this is the only other entry containing "RISK".</td>', 'Surprised that this is the only other entry containing "RISK".', '2008-09-21 01:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966305, 722169, 78021, '<td valign="top">Risky...or just stupid?</td>', 'Risky...or just stupid?', '2008-09-21 01:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966666, 722197, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool photo: I totally understand the meaning behind it. Excellent capture of the sunlight shining through the water. 10</td>', 'Pretty cool photo: I totally understand the meaning behind it. Excellent capture of the sunlight shining through the water. 10', '2008-09-21 14:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966667, 722263, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice and I love your choice of frame too! 10</td>', 'Very, very nice and I love your choice of frame too! 10', '2008-09-21 14:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966668, 722293, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice use of rule of thirds.</td>', 'Nice use of rule of thirds.', '2008-09-21 14:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966670, 722134, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not raw - yuck! Cook ''em with butter. Nice take on the challenge!</td>', 'Not raw - yuck! Cook ''em with butter. Nice take on the challenge!', '2008-09-21 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966671, 722307, 62187, '<td valign="top">I almost think a conversion to black and white would have greatly improved your image.</td>', 'I almost think a conversion to black and white would have greatly improved your image.', '2008-09-21 14:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966672, 722227, 62187, '<td valign="top">Better him then me - I like your perspective better.</td>', 'Better him then me - I like your perspective better.', '2008-09-21 14:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966673, 722324, 62187, '<td valign="top">Mumbly Peg - that''s what we used to call that game. Excellent take on the challenge and I like the low lighting: 9</td>', 'Mumbly Peg - that''s what we used to call that game. Excellent take on the challenge and I like the low lighting: 9', '2008-09-21 14:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966674, 721885, 62187, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but I think the reflection (lower right) is a little distracting.</td>', 'A nice idea but I think the reflection (lower right) is a little distracting.', '2008-09-21 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966676, 722169, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is very nice, I like the blown-out background, but is it really a risk or just stupidity? I''d venture to say that the voters will still go somewhat high rather then low.</td>', 'The photo is very nice, I like the blown-out background, but is it really a risk or just stupidity? I''d venture to say that the voters will still go somewhat high rather then low.', '2008-09-21 14:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966681, 722040, 62187, '<td valign="top">I actually think the risk is very minimal but I understand your message and the camera work is excellent to me: love the shadow. Now, if you really wanted to portray ''Risk'', the rider should have taken his helmet off! (I know, it''s illegal in some places) Anyway: 10</td>', 'I actually think the risk is very minimal but I understand your message and the camera work is excellent to me: love the shadow. Now, if you really wanted to portray ''Risk'', the rider should have taken his helmet off! (I know, it''s illegal in some places) Anyway: 10', '2008-09-21 14:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966682, 722161, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes, very risky!</td>', 'Yes, very risky!', '2008-09-21 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966684, 722039, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice and should do well. (I can''t wait for Aviation Nation in November!) 9</td>', 'Very nice and should do well. (I can''t wait for Aviation Nation in November!) 9', '2008-09-21 14:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966685, 722311, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not a very ''attractive'' (?) photo but I certainly think you have a great message here. Bonus points for that: 8</td>', 'Not a very ''attractive'' (?) photo but I certainly think you have a great message here. Bonus points for that: 8', '2008-09-21 14:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966686, 721774, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very artistic looking all washed out and all. I really like it: 9</td>', 'Very artistic looking all washed out and all. I really like it: 9', '2008-09-21 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966687, 721174, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I won''t be the only one to say nice focus.</td>', 'I''m sure I won''t be the only one to say nice focus.', '2008-09-21 14:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966688, 721146, 62187, '<td valign="top">Excellent work behind the camera. 8</td>', 'Excellent work behind the camera. 8', '2008-09-21 14:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966691, 721702, 62187, '<td valign="top">From this perspective, to me, it looks like you''ve already done the climbing. ???</td>', 'From this perspective, to me, it looks like you''ve already done the climbing. ???', '2008-09-21 14:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966693, 722119, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think you''re right. You go first! The only knit-picky think I see is that piece of grass to the lower left and that bright spot. But, I may just be trippin''! 10</td>', 'I think you''re right. You go first! The only knit-picky think I see is that piece of grass to the lower left and that bright spot. But, I may just be trippin''! 10', '2008-09-21 14:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966697, 722251, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, nice crop. But like you said: ''A smooth ride'' is risky???? I guess that''s why so many people are riding. In this case, I think your choice of title will cause a lower score while the photo shows an element of ''Risk'' on it''s own.</td>', 'Nice focus, nice crop. But like you said: ''A smooth ride'' is risky???? I guess that''s why so many people are riding. In this case, I think your choice of title will cause a lower score while the photo shows an element of ''Risk'' on it''s own.', '2008-09-21 14:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966698, 722139, 62187, '<td valign="top">You mean gambling is risky? Is that it? Some better focus I think would probably have improved the image.</td>', 'You mean gambling is risky? Is that it? Some better focus I think would probably have improved the image.', '2008-09-21 14:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966699, 720823, 62187, '<td valign="top">Didn''t we see this guy with a big dump-truck headed for him?</td>', 'Didn''t we see this guy with a big dump-truck headed for him?', '2008-09-21 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966700, 721766, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sure, that''s terribly risky! So is getting stuck on a crosswalk in the middle of a busy street. Here''s this:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.zebraexpert.in/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Zebra in India</a></td>', 'Sure, that''s terribly risky! So is getting stuck on a crosswalk in the middle of a busy street. Here''s this: Zebra in India', '2008-09-21 15:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966702, 721929, 62187, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of nice pastel colors. Are you sure his name isn''t ''Edward Six-Hands''?</td>', 'Lot''s of nice pastel colors. Are you sure his name isn''t ''Edward Six-Hands''?', '2008-09-21 15:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966703, 721806, 62187, '<td valign="top">I agree the risk is high.</td>', 'I agree the risk is high.', '2008-09-21 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966704, 722076, 62187, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the smoke.</td>', 'Good capture of the smoke.', '2008-09-21 15:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966705, 721604, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice camera work. Details like the stains on the table could have improved some peoples outlook I think.</td>', 'Nice camera work. Details like the stains on the table could have improved some peoples outlook I think.', '2008-09-21 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966706, 721979, 62187, '<td valign="top">Is it the Romans!?!?!?!?!</td>', 'Is it the Romans!?!?!?!?!', '2008-09-21 15:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966707, 721080, 62187, '<td valign="top">Ummmm...the photo is ok...I''d rather not see dead animals thanks...</td>', 'Ummmm...the photo is ok...I''d rather not see dead animals thanks...', '2008-09-21 15:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966708, 722310, 62187, '<td valign="top">The lightness of the colors are kinda strange. Not bad, just strange. It reminds me of paintings by Monet. Overall, I like the photo but I''m not sure it''s portraying ''Risk'' 100% to me.</td>', 'The lightness of the colors are kinda strange. Not bad, just strange. It reminds me of paintings by Monet. Overall, I like the photo but I''m not sure it''s portraying ''Risk'' 100% to me.', '2008-09-21 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966709, 721865, 62187, '<td valign="top">...and not wearing socks? That''s crazy! I would never do that...</td>', '...and not wearing socks? That''s crazy! I would never do that...', '2008-09-21 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966710, 721899, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if you would have taken that little twig near the blade of grass away.</td>', 'I think it would be better if you would have taken that little twig near the blade of grass away.', '2008-09-21 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966711, 722078, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think ''Step on a Crack'' might have been a better title.</td>', 'I think ''Step on a Crack'' might have been a better title.', '2008-09-21 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966712, 722020, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think even with basic editing you would have been allowed to clone out those annoying bright spots. The lighting is a little harsh but the flame looks really cool and your message fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'I think even with basic editing you would have been allowed to clone out those annoying bright spots. The lighting is a little harsh but the flame looks really cool and your message fits the challenge very well.', '2008-09-21 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966714, 722112, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not to hip on the dead animal thing but at least this one is part of nature. Your focus is excellent!</td>', 'Not to hip on the dead animal thing but at least this one is part of nature. Your focus is excellent!', '2008-09-21 15:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966716, 722145, 62187, '<td valign="top">Funny - looks like you actually took a nibble! I like this one, it''s very smooth while still holding it''s crisp focus. 9</td>', 'Funny - looks like you actually took a nibble! I like this one, it''s very smooth while still holding it''s crisp focus. 9', '2008-09-21 15:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966717, 720732, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the attempt at an ''artistic'' edit.</td>', 'I can appreciate the attempt at an ''artistic'' edit.', '2008-09-21 15:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966718, 722266, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been cooler looking without the red.</td>', 'I think it would have been cooler looking without the red.', '2008-09-21 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966727, 721132, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can certainly appreciate your work - it''s awesome! 10</td>', 'I can certainly appreciate your work - it''s awesome! 10', '2008-09-21 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966729, 722172, 62187, '<td valign="top">An awesome photo and fits the challenge well. I''m wondering if a wider perspective would be bette? I still like it as is: 10</td>', 'An awesome photo and fits the challenge well. I''m wondering if a wider perspective would be bette? I still like it as is: 10', '2008-09-21 15:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966733, 722124, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo (but not my favorite colors - wow!) with super sharp focus. The title is very clever and while I''m sure the ladybug feels no ''risk'', it still fits the challenge very well: 9</td>', 'An excellent photo (but not my favorite colors - wow!) with super sharp focus. The title is very clever and while I''m sure the ladybug feels no ''risk'', it still fits the challenge very well: 9', '2008-09-21 15:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966735, 721795, 62187, '<td valign="top">Come on - why not give yourself ''Blackjack''!?!?!?! The flash is a little bright to me.</td>', 'Come on - why not give yourself ''Blackjack''!?!?!?! The flash is a little bright to me.', '2008-09-21 15:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966738, 721317, 62187, '<td valign="top">This is the only game I ever play, I love it and it was the first thing I thought of when I saw the ''Risk'' challenge. I''ve gone through 81 of the 126 entries and yours is the first from the board game that I''ve seen. I really like it but there is a slight tilt to the left that bothers me. Very political either way with maybe a hidden message? 8</td>', 'This is the only game I ever play, I love it and it was the first thing I thought of when I saw the ''Risk'' challenge. I''ve gone through 81 of the 126 entries and yours is the first from the board game that I''ve seen. I really like it but there is a slight tilt to the left that bothers me. Very political either way with maybe a hidden message? 8', '2008-09-21 15:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966739, 721815, 62187, '<td valign="top">Another one where humor in taking a risk seems funnier then humor in safety. The cabbage is telling me it would look better in black and white - maybe? 7</td>', 'Another one where humor in taking a risk seems funnier then humor in safety. The cabbage is telling me it would look better in black and white - maybe? 7', '2008-09-21 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966740, 721267, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not risky, just mean! };&gt;)</td>', 'Not risky, just mean! };>)', '2008-09-21 15:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966741, 721829, 62187, '<td valign="top">Did anybody check to see if Bin Laden was hiding down there? Nice find...</td>', 'Did anybody check to see if Bin Laden was hiding down there? Nice find...', '2008-09-21 15:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966744, 722061, 62187, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.airrace.org/indexJS.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Reno Air Race</a> - Nice capture but looks a little far away for the lens. Maybe leaving some more dead space on the sides or using the rule of thirds might have taken some of the distance/heat distortion away or cleared it up?</td>', 'Reno Air Race - Nice capture but looks a little far away for the lens. Maybe leaving some more dead space on the sides or using the rule of thirds might have taken some of the distance/heat distortion away or cleared it up?', '2008-09-21 15:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966746, 721913, 62187, '<td valign="top">A great idea but for me, the pill bottle takes away from the artistic quality.</td>', 'A great idea but for me, the pill bottle takes away from the artistic quality.', '2008-09-21 15:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966747, 720527, 62187, '<td valign="top">There ya go! I hope others realize what you are showing them. Maybe that''s a risk in itself!?!?!?! 8</td>', 'There ya go! I hope others realize what you are showing them. Maybe that''s a risk in itself!?!?!?! 8', '2008-09-21 15:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966748, 722279, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not my favorite in the bunch but it certainly fits the challenge and is well executed: 10</td>', 'Not my favorite in the bunch but it certainly fits the challenge and is well executed: 10', '2008-09-21 15:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966749, 722211, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve used a fish-eye lens which is totally cool for your photo. Excellent processing! 10</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve used a fish-eye lens which is totally cool for your photo. Excellent processing! 10', '2008-09-21 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966754, 722097, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice timing - it took me a second to see what was going on.</td>', 'Nice timing - it took me a second to see what was going on.', '2008-09-21 16:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966758, 721822, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like a lot of noise reduction was used as it looks fairly smooth to me or perhaps it was caused by taking a photo thru glass. Unless you''re actually swimming with the sharks then your just crazy!</td>', 'It looks like a lot of noise reduction was used as it looks fairly smooth to me or perhaps it was caused by taking a photo thru glass. Unless you''re actually swimming with the sharks then your just crazy!', '2008-09-21 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966759, 721966, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the edit but without the title, the photo would be meaningless to ''Risk'' taking. And by the way, I just saw on TV the other day some dude beat David Blaine''s underwater breath holding record of something like 17:04 - crazy! Anyway, I can appreciate your out of the box edit.</td>', 'I like the edit but without the title, the photo would be meaningless to ''Risk'' taking. And by the way, I just saw on TV the other day some dude beat David Blaine''s underwater breath holding record of something like 17:04 - crazy! Anyway, I can appreciate your out of the box edit.', '2008-09-21 16:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966760, 722126, 62187, '<td valign="top">How sad! Very nice photo: 9</td>', 'How sad! Very nice photo: 9', '2008-09-21 16:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966761, 721900, 62187, '<td valign="top">Getting kinda tired with all the ''Risky'' gambling themed photo especially since I live in Vegas. But this one I like the best: 10</td>', 'Getting kinda tired with all the ''Risky'' gambling themed photo especially since I live in Vegas. But this one I like the best: 10', '2008-09-21 16:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966762, 721285, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you just gotta stick your neck out!</td>', 'Sometimes you just gotta stick your neck out!', '2008-09-21 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966764, 722102, 62187, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge but I''m having trouble telling how far ''down'' we''re talking about here. 7</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge but I''m having trouble telling how far ''down'' we''re talking about here. 7', '2008-09-21 16:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966766, 722101, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like a stunt I might try while not expecting a super score - I like it!</td>', 'Looks like a stunt I might try while not expecting a super score - I like it!', '2008-09-21 16:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966767, 721696, 62187, '<td valign="top">Jam? Shouldn''t that be kept in the fridge? It''s kind of a sad photo to me - not photographically but in the message. Really? It''s probably for her own good anyway - today''s kids are eating horribly. Anyway, not the best photo but I guess the message is good and she is taking a risk huh? 7</td>', 'Jam? Shouldn''t that be kept in the fridge? It''s kind of a sad photo to me - not photographically but in the message. Really? It''s probably for her own good anyway - today''s kids are eating horribly. Anyway, not the best photo but I guess the message is good and she is taking a risk huh? 7', '2008-09-21 16:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966770, 722019, 62187, '<td valign="top">Shooting blanks is a risk? Don''t you know you''re supposed to take those things downrange and bury them! They''ll make so much residue your M16 will get jammed. Just remember: S.P.O.R.T.S. Anyway, I get your message and hope all is well...photographically, I have no problems with your entry. The focus and contrast are excellent. I know, it''s the risk of being in the Military: especially these days.</td>', 'Shooting blanks is a risk? Don''t you know you''re supposed to take those things downrange and bury them! They''ll make so much residue your M16 will get jammed. Just remember: S.P.O.R.T.S. Anyway, I get your message and hope all is well...photographically, I have no problems with your entry. The focus and contrast are excellent. I know, it''s the risk of being in the Military: especially these days.', '2008-09-21 16:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966771, 722400, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think a less ''centered'' shot might have improved the overall appearance.</td>', 'I think a less ''centered'' shot might have improved the overall appearance.', '2008-09-21 16:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966772, 720627, 62187, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I think the meaning would have been lost. It''s a pretty cool photo and nice focus.</td>', 'Without the title, I think the meaning would have been lost. It''s a pretty cool photo and nice focus.', '2008-09-21 16:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966774, 721199, 62187, '<td valign="top">That is far too many bugs on one flower - yuck! But, a very nice catch - for you - not the bug - he''s just creepy..</td>', 'That is far too many bugs on one flower - yuck! But, a very nice catch - for you - not the bug - he''s just creepy..', '2008-09-21 16:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966795, 720808, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, hmmmm - I''m trying to make it work with the challenge. For me, it''s kind of a stretch. It''s a lovely photo but the crop is strange to me. The sepia is very nice.</td>', 'Well, hmmmm - I''m trying to make it work with the challenge. For me, it''s kind of a stretch. It''s a lovely photo but the crop is strange to me. The sepia is very nice.', '2008-09-21 16:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966798, 721960, 62187, '<td valign="top">The meaning of your message must be lost to me...maybe it''s your title as what those boys are doing does seem risky.</td>', 'The meaning of your message must be lost to me...maybe it''s your title as what those boys are doing does seem risky.', '2008-09-21 16:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966800, 721813, 62187, '<td valign="top">Experimenting with shallow focus - nice. Risky - I''m not sure.</td>', 'Experimenting with shallow focus - nice. Risky - I''m not sure.', '2008-09-21 16:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966802, 721255, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your crop is good and the scene seems bizarre to me.</td>', 'Your crop is good and the scene seems bizarre to me.', '2008-09-21 16:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966803, 721214, 62187, '<td valign="top">A very crisp photo.</td>', 'A very crisp photo.', '2008-09-21 16:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966804, 721729, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s some sort of zoom lens!</td>', 'I hope that''s some sort of zoom lens!', '2008-09-21 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966806, 721812, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice timing.</td>', 'Very nice timing.', '2008-09-21 16:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966807, 721800, 62187, '<td valign="top">The focus is very good.</td>', 'The focus is very good.', '2008-09-21 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966810, 722334, 62187, '<td valign="top">I guess I''ll have to take your word for it. I think a slightly tighter crop might have helped: the long side of the box to the left is slightly distracting.</td>', 'I guess I''ll have to take your word for it. I think a slightly tighter crop might have helped: the long side of the box to the left is slightly distracting.', '2008-09-21 16:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966812, 721926, 62187, '<td valign="top">My racing shots haven''t been doing well. I like yours - it''s a nice capture and I appreciate your efforts.</td>', 'My racing shots haven''t been doing well. I like yours - it''s a nice capture and I appreciate your efforts.', '2008-09-21 16:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966813, 721175, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks heavy on the jelly but a nice action shot and fits the challenge.</td>', 'Looks heavy on the jelly but a nice action shot and fits the challenge.', '2008-09-21 16:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966815, 721922, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not bad on the shutter - I don''t know this game. Playing with sticks (?) might hold a certain degree of risk especially without padding.</td>', 'Not bad on the shutter - I don''t know this game. Playing with sticks (?) might hold a certain degree of risk especially without padding.', '2008-09-21 16:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966823, 721906, 62187, '<td valign="top">Signs like this crack me up: it''s like it''s saying - ''Watch Your Hands'' as they get torn off! Maybe it should say ''Keep hands away''? Anyway, a good one for the challenge!</td>', 'Signs like this crack me up: it''s like it''s saying - ''Watch Your Hands'' as they get torn off! Maybe it should say ''Keep hands away''? Anyway, a good one for the challenge!', '2008-09-21 16:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966826, 721703, 62187, '<td valign="top">It really looks like she''s gonna land on him - good job!</td>', 'It really looks like she''s gonna land on him - good job!', '2008-09-21 16:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966829, 722190, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s the green one. No, the green one I said! Green, green, gre...</td>', 'It''s the green one. No, the green one I said! Green, green, gre...', '2008-09-21 16:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966831, 720429, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I love old stuff. It might be nice to see some more of the fence but this gets the message out. 8</td>', 'Very nice - I love old stuff. It might be nice to see some more of the fence but this gets the message out. 8', '2008-09-21 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966834, 720911, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes it is. Slightly grainy and I must say, an over-used topic for this challenge. But that''s not affecting my scoring. Hey, you got a pretty good hand - I''d stay.</td>', 'Yes it is. Slightly grainy and I must say, an over-used topic for this challenge. But that''s not affecting my scoring. Hey, you got a pretty good hand - I''d stay.', '2008-09-21 16:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
