(4970894, 720711, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems to not be as clear as it should be, so I looked at the file details. I think the lack of clarity is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 64k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)<br/> <br/>You also had another 40 pixels of image size you could have used for the horizontal. Always make use of the maximum possible size in at least one direction.</td>', 'This seems to not be as clear as it should be, so I looked at the file details. I think the lack of clarity is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 64k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) You also had another 40 pixels of image size you could have used for the horizontal. Always make use of the maximum possible size in at least one direction.', '2008-09-23 23:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
