(4971578, 722211, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent job Marak - Better than you predicted but not as good as it was doing earlier in the week.</td>', 'Excellent job Marak - Better than you predicted but not as good as it was doing earlier in the week.', '2008-09-24 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4971587, 721979, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one made me stop, look and think.  On DPC, as far as voting goes, that''s not always good for score, but score is not everything.  A picture that makes me stop and think is a good one, in my opinion.  I like the angle you chose - it suits your title and what you were trying to convey very well, and adds "life" to an otherwise static display.  In general, statues and such don''t often score well (though they can - it depends).  In my universe, I often like more - more picture to tell more of the story, but bearing in mind we have only limited pixels to use here, your crop is good.  I think the only thing I can see that may need work is the bluish fringing around the upper child''s head and along the back of the girl.  I suspect this is due mostly to the lighting conditions.  Check your original to see if any was added with the brightness/contrast adjustment, then watch for that in the future if that was the case.</td>', 'This one made me stop, look and think.  On DPC, as far as voting goes, that''s not always good for score, but score is not everything.  A picture that makes me stop and think is a good one, in my opinion.  I like the angle you chose - it suits your title and what you were trying to convey very well, and adds "life" to an otherwise static display.  In general, statues and such don''t often score well (though they can - it depends).  In my universe, I often like more - more picture to tell more of the story, but bearing in mind we have only limited pixels to use here, your crop is good.  I think the only thing I can see that may need work is the bluish fringing around the upper child''s head and along the back of the girl.  I suspect this is due mostly to the lighting conditions.  Check your original to see if any was added with the brightness/contrast adjustment, then watch for that in the future if that was the case.', '2008-09-24 07:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4971590, 722211, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of my highest rated in this challenge - not only does it meet the challenge well, it''s an intriguing shot.  Nice use of the fisheye and the angle!</td>', 'One of my highest rated in this challenge - not only does it meet the challenge well, it''s an intriguing shot.  Nice use of the fisheye and the angle!', '2008-09-24 07:15:28.000000', NULL, 0),
