(4972245, 721812, 19333, '<td valign="top">Thank to you all who voted, twice to those who commented ;-)<br/> <br/>Gracias, Gabriel. La verdad es que no hice las fotos pensando en el challenge, pero esta salio justo para el tema. Esta tarde la pondre en OD<br/> <br/>Tanguera, you just hitted the nail, the pic''s too flat, but wanted to preserve detail underneath the planes and no masking is allowed in Basic. A stonger post processing adds punch to the images, something like this one, taken the very same day...<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.focusu.com/gallery/data/d9fc5b73a8d78fad3d6dffe419384e70/1486_p20909.jpeg'', strrpos(''//www.focusu.com/gallery/data/d9fc5b73a8d78fad3d6dffe419384e70/1486_p20909.jpeg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.focusu.com/gallery/data/d9fc5b73a8d78fad3d6dffe419384e70/1486_p20909.jpeg"/> <br/></td>', 'Thank to you all who voted, twice to those who commented ;-) Gracias, Gabriel. La verdad es que no hice las fotos pensando en el challenge, pero esta salio justo para el tema. Esta tarde la pondre en OD Tanguera, you just hitted the nail, the pic''s too flat, but wanted to preserve detail underneath the planes and no masking is allowed in Basic. A stonger post processing adds punch to the images, something like this one, taken the very same day...  ', '2008-09-24 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 0),
