(4972733, 721314, 97282, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gnomey:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey, that''s in SLC, just noticed that. Great shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep it is Salt Lake City.  They were doing this competition right outside my work.</td>', 'Originally posted by Gnomey: Hey, that''s in SLC, just noticed that. Great shot!   Yep it is Salt Lake City.  They were doing this competition right outside my work.', '2008-09-24 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
