(4972962, 722296, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this one was perfect for the challenge - and a darn fine shot on its own as well!  Great crop - dynamic and brings us to the action.  Very good capture of his expression and I love the visible heat waves.  I think this was the right choice over the others you''ve posted.  And congrats on a new entry in your top row, as well as an excellent finish!</td>', 'I think this one was perfect for the challenge - and a darn fine shot on its own as well!  Great crop - dynamic and brings us to the action.  Very good capture of his expression and I love the visible heat waves.  I think this was the right choice over the others you''ve posted.  And congrats on a new entry in your top row, as well as an excellent finish!', '2008-09-24 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4973040, 721903, 35602, '<td valign="top">Oh My God:  I can''t believe I actually got a ribbon finally after all these years.  I was not going to enter the challenge, but thought I would take a chance.  As I went to bed last night and saw the score, thought well it is good but not winner material.  Then when I looked at my e-mail first this morning, I got a request for proof from dp.  I could not believe I had actually placed in the top 3.  Thanks to all who have not lost faith in me.  I am ecstatic.  Now that I hardly go out to take pictures at all, I get a ribbon.  Well, will wonders never cease.</td>', 'Oh My God:  I can''t believe I actually got a ribbon finally after all these years.  I was not going to enter the challenge, but thought I would take a chance.  As I went to bed last night and saw the score, thought well it is good but not winner material.  Then when I looked at my e-mail first this morning, I got a request for proof from dp.  I could not believe I had actually placed in the top 3.  Thanks to all who have not lost faith in me.  I am ecstatic.  Now that I hardly go out to take pictures at all, I get a ribbon.  Well, will wonders never cease.', '2008-09-24 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4973071, 722210, 31535, '<td valign="top">Well done. Clearly a great shot. Well deserving of the Blue. Now you just have to get a red and a 4th to finish your collection.</td>', 'Well done. Clearly a great shot. Well deserving of the Blue. Now you just have to get a red and a 4th to finish your collection.', '2008-09-24 17:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4973121, 722396, 73575, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the sky at all; otherwise an interesting shot.<br/> <br/>If I interpret your title correctly, ''simulated'' means this is a render from Rollercoaster Tycoon or something like that and therefore not a photograph at all? I''m not familiar with any of those type of games, but the lighting and the triangulated frames seem to bear that out. On the other hand, parts of the track seem to show weathering, so I really couldn''t say one way or the other...</td>', 'Don''t care for the sky at all; otherwise an interesting shot. If I interpret your title correctly, ''simulated'' means this is a render from Rollercoaster Tycoon or something like that and therefore not a photograph at all? I''m not familiar with any of those type of games, but the lighting and the triangulated frames seem to bear that out. On the other hand, parts of the track seem to show weathering, so I really couldn''t say one way or the other...', '2008-09-24 18:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4973175, 721132, 51793, '<td valign="top">Hey man congratulations on second. Only thing is Second is the first loser... ;D<br/> <br/>J/K/ Great work, I really like this picture.</td>', 'Hey man congratulations on second. Only thing is Second is the first loser... ;D J/K/ Great work, I really like this picture.', '2008-09-24 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
