(4973223, 722210, 19982, '<td valign="top">What can I say...?  If I had to come in second, at least I came in second to a much more imaginative image defining risk itself!  Very nicely done!  <br/> <br/>I''m not blowing smoke here - I actually found the images in this challenge fairly boring - my own image included! Yours was the only one that creatively said anything!  Congrats!</td>', 'What can I say...?  If I had to come in second, at least I came in second to a much more imaginative image defining risk itself!  Very nicely done!   I''m not blowing smoke here - I actually found the images in this challenge fairly boring - my own image included! Yours was the only one that creatively said anything!  Congrats!', '2008-09-24 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
